adAt":"2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"1129529","title":"The Next Passage (Alternamorphs, #2)","author":"K.A. Applegate","url":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8985575730?utm_medium=api&utm_source=rss","coverUrl":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1375604644l/1129529._SX98_.jpg","rating":2,"readAt":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"42397849","title":"Burnout: The Secret to Unlocking the Stress Cycle","author":"Emily Nagoski","url":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8930830253?utm_medium=api&utm_source=rss","coverUrl":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1551216612l/42397849._SX98_.jpg","rating":2,"readAt":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"}]},"mastodonPosts":[{"id":"117503744178368007","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117503744178368007","createdAt":"2026-10-25T21:47:26.497Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Watched The Awful Truth. RomCom has a pretty pre-code feel despite technically not violating the Hayes Code. Cary Grant is fantastic, and Dunne feels like a Hepburn clone in parts, but probably they’re all just in the same soup. Lots of small moments that show why they’re both stars.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/MovieReview\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>MovieReview</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117503744081316344","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/503/744/081/316/344/original/30f62a73ddc75481.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/503/744/081/316/344/small/30f62a73ddc75481.jpg","description":"Grant and Dunne with some Cowboy"}]},{"id":"117503457723663229","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117503457723663229","createdAt":"2026-10-25T20:34:35.524Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>I had a fun time animating a Grave Lily decaying for a Dot-Man power-up! Not the most complex art or animation, but it is a nice little touch for the game feel.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/pixelArt\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>pixelArt</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117503456911874405","type":"gifv","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/503/456/911/874/405/original/6e0fcb026856b827.mp4","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/503/456/911/874/405/small/6e0fcb026856b827.png","description":"Grave lily decaying"}]},{"id":"117487707747133379","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117487707747133379","createdAt":"2026-10-23T01:49:09.951Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Watched The Amazing Adventure. Cary Grant was fantastic despite being in a fairly predictable plot. Sadly the cut that survived the war was about 20 minutes shorter than the original and it showed in parts. Fun as a time capsule of the Great Depression!</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/MovieReview\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>MovieReview</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117487707636466351","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/487/707/636/466/351/original/bb58891d0d298046.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/487/707/636/466/351/small/bb58891d0d298046.jpg","description":"Cary Grant looking pretty"}]},{"id":"117486864406104091","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117486864406104091","createdAt":"2026-10-22T22:14:41.589Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Figuring out the best way to have Dot-Man be able to clear collapsed rubble with his “Tunnel Boring” upgrade was a fun challenge. Finding ways to have it happen smoothly and leave the right amount of rubble behind was fun!</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/GameDev\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>GameDev</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117486864261633008","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/486/864/261/633/008/original/10ab8d200b2c33a2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/486/864/261/633/008/small/10ab8d200b2c33a2.jpg","description":"Tunnel wth rubble after clearing"},{"id":"117486864328339250","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/486/864/328/339/250/original/cc7ace3c37043036.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/486/864/328/339/250/small/cc7ace3c37043036.jpg","description":"Tunnel with rubble before clearing"}]},{"id":"117485754338217252","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117485754338217252","createdAt":"2026-10-22T17:32:23.299Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Sometimes seeing a really horrible <a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/GameDev\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>GameDev</span></a> design is enough to make me fiery about fixing things. Nothing is harder than a white sheet of paper, and a broken look can be so helpful in framing what I don’t like.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/design\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>design</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117485754275930664","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/485/754/275/930/664/original/3d8b447c77c25a4b.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/485/754/275/930/664/small/3d8b447c77c25a4b.jpg","description":"A blue rectangle with white text. The text is arranged in two sections. The top section is smaller and reads, \"right on. will check it out once i reach a decent stopping point.\" The larger bottom section reads, \"Please don't yet. It's horrible and i'm fixing it. Nearly vomited in my mouth at the multiple layers of modals.\" The words \"Now\" and a verified checkmark symbol are in the bottom right corner."}]}]},"__N_SSG":true}